flowchart TD
    A[Recruiter submits credentials] --> B[Register/Login route]
    B --> C{Register?}
    C -- Yes --> D[generate_password_hash password]
    D --> E[(users table stores password_hash)]
    C -- No --> F[check_password_hash]
    F --> G{Valid user?}
    G -- No --> H[Flash invalid login message]
    G -- Yes --> I[Create Flask session user_id and username]
    I --> J[Protected recruiter routes]

    J --> K{login_required passes?}
    K -- No session --> L[Redirect to /login]
    K -- Session exists --> M[Allow dashboard/job/upload/status/report route]

    M --> N[Ownership checks]
    N --> O{record belongs to current_user_id?}
    O -- No --> P[Reject action or redirect]
    O -- Yes --> Q[Allow operation]

    Q --> R[File upload controls]
    R --> S[allowed_file permits PDF/DOCX only]
    S --> T[secure_filename cleans file name]
    T --> U[MAX_CONTENT_LENGTH limits upload size]
    U --> V[Save only in uploads folder]
